      "body": "One row per individual with its father, mother, sex and affected status, as a PED file or an nf-core samplesheet writes them. A square is a male, a circle a female and a diamond a person of unknown sex; a filled symbol is affected, an open one unaffected and a hatched one of unknown status; a slash marks a death. The third family has no father in the table, so its children hang from the mother alone. Click an individual to narrow the table below to them. Input: the samplesheet of nf-core/raredisease or a PED file.\n",
